  "body": "Safari and Firefox agreed on a subset of the CookieStore API to match only the `document.cookie` behavior. The subset is the following:\n\n1. Only cookie names and values are shared via the `CookieStore.get()`/`getAll()` methods. This way, we do not expose more than what `document.cookie` already offers. See #238.\n\nThis is currently implemented in Firefox and enabled in Nightly.\n\nCC @annevk ",
